flowchart LR
    Caller([📞 Caller])
    Studio[Studio Flow<br/>routes by DNIS /<br/>versioning]
    TwiML[TwiML Bin<br/>substitutes<br/>isAgent, isRepeat,<br/>aiAgentDomain]
    TAC[TAC Server<br/>ConversationRelay<br/>WebSocket]
    Claude[Claude LLM<br/>Anthropic API]
    Tools[(Tools:<br/>LeadDepo,<br/>TMT Legacy,<br/>Memory,<br/>Email)]
    Flex[Flex TaskRouter<br/>human agent]

    Caller -->|dials number| Studio
    Studio -->|serves TwiML with query params| TwiML
    TwiML -->|Redirect to /twiml| TAC
    TAC <-->|LLM inference| Claude
    Claude -->|tool_use| Tools
    Tools -->|tool_result| Claude
    Claude -->|handoff tool| Flex
    Flex -.->|no reservation| TAC
    TAC -->|reissue CR<br/>with takeback=true| Caller

    classDef caller fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0369a1,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
